                  "name": "stNoteTitle",
                  "fill": "#222222",
                  "content": "关键需求标注",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "lQDZZ",
                  "name": "stNoteWrap",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#F7F7F7",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": 16,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "cornerRadius": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "o2uAu",
                      "name": "stNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 运行参数变更需写审计日志（action=config.update），并记录 before/after。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "bQuq8",
                      "name": "stNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 「决策 P95 延迟」目标 < 50ms（概要设计 §6）；超出需在页面标红。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "4iI7V",
                      "name": "stNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 账号停用后，其未处置案件需支持转交；停用不影响已产生的审计记录。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "DmBQX",
                      "name": "stNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 模型引擎配置区在 G-01 确认前保持只读/置灰，避免误以为已支持模型决策。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
